RunnableExample fields: title, description, source, check, workspace, lastRun.
initialize: initialize editable text and allocate a separate workspace.
Text getters/setters and updateTitle:description:source:check: expose editable documentation.
run: evaluate source with typed result and transcript; preserve that response; execute check without replacing the source result; propagate any failure; return the source response.
workspace and result: expose scratch object and last typed value.
reset: replace workspace and clear lastRun.
inspectorMetadata: expose editable text properties.


capture:value: retain a name/value pair, install it in the workspace, and preserve its object reference. run restores captured inputs before evaluating; reset restores captured bindings after replacing the workspace. Observed-result metadata is stored as captured bindings.
